# ── Legacy domain redirects ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both legacy domains must be activated manually before these rules fire:
#
#   Step 1 — Netlify (repeat for EACH domain):
#     Site → Domain management → Add domain → enter the domain → Verify
#     Netlify will display the DNS values to point at.
#
#   Step 2 — GoDaddy (repeat for EACH domain):
#     DNS → Add/edit A record → Host: @ → Points to: 75.2.60.5  (Netlify LB)
#     DNS → Add/edit CNAME   → Host: www → Points to: eternallifehospice.netlify.app
#
#   Once DNS propagates (~minutes to 1 hour), Netlify provisions SSL automatically
#   and these redirect rules begin firing.
